{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1301010436","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1301010436","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1310423001:0":{"text":"各位，闹事者已被驱离，活死人也被无畏的勇士们制服了！现在，我以大公的名义宣布：舞会继续！","source_cn":"各位，闹事者已被驱离，活死人也被无畏的勇士们制服了！现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD1D1A1B5BE60075","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310423002:1":{"text":"至高无上的神明在注视着我们，我们必能在神的护佑下完成祭典！","source_cn":"至高无上的神明在注视着我们，我们必能在神的护佑下完成祭典！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A8B0BD8C5F9B14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310423003:1":{"text":"什么？都出了这样可怕的事情，还要继续奏乐，继续跳舞？","source_cn":"什么？都出了这样可怕的事情，还要继续奏乐，继续跳舞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A6C9CC4677C73F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310423004:0":{"text":"漫漫女士，其实正是因为大家都惧怕活死人，所以舞会才要继续。","source_cn":"漫漫女士，其实正是因为大家都惧怕活死人，所以舞会才要继续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A8345D35E92412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310423005:0":{"text":"可……为什么？","source_cn":"可……为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6BBD639220C9524","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl