ent_title_status":""},"say:18:1310425002:1":{"text":"舞会结束后，请大家前往仪式现场，一起见证冬日祭典中最为荣耀和神圣的时刻！","source_cn":"舞会结束后，请大家前往仪式现场，一起见证冬日祭典中最为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F8006D4DD6F47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1310425003:1":{"text":"对了，你们还不知道吧，点火之前，“受选者”需要为冰雕献上<style=\"highlight\">七瓣蓝绒花</style>！","source_cn":"对了，你们还不知道吧，点火之前，“受选者”需要为冰雕献...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D7B456BFB361E1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310425004:1":{"text":"可是……公主殿下，蓝绒花不是六瓣的吗？","source_cn":"可是……公主殿下，蓝绒花不是六瓣的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE8AD3E779082288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1310425005:1":{"text":"是呀！但是也有七瓣的蓝绒花。在白山，七瓣的蓝绒花是<style=\"highlight\">“奇迹”的象征</style>，寄托着古代英雄的意志。","source_cn":"是呀！但是也有七瓣的蓝绒花。在白山，七瓣的蓝绒花是<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB57C58F4671594B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1310425006:1":{"text":"历史老师说，过去与恶魔的抗争非常惨烈，几乎是不可能赢的战争。","source_cn":"历史老师说，过去与恶魔的抗争非常惨烈，几乎是不可能赢的战争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8764C2F7E06C4D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"